        {"source": "schematic", "quote": "+12V ... C19 1uF 25V ... D11 MBR0530 ... L2 10uH (Power sheet)"}
      ],
      "impact": "If U12's reference is ~1.23 V, the '+12 V' rail will sit near 7.4 V instead of 12 V, weakening/incorrectly driving the 12 V alarm outputs on connector J12 and any external 12 V load.",
